{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26998","headline":"咏南池嘉莲 · 姚合","name":"咏南池嘉莲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"芙蓉池里叶田田，一本双花出碧泉。\n浓淡共妍香各散，东西分艳蔕相连。\n自知政术无他异，纵是祯祥亦偶然。\n四野人闻皆尽喜，争来入郭看嘉莲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26998.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26998","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}